description:
Design a two-input XNOR gate that outputs Y based on the logical equivalence of inputs A and B. The module includes supply voltage connections to external voltage sources, ensuring proper functionality within integrated circuit environments. This XNOR gate delivers a true output when both inputs are the same, complying with standard digital logic design principles.
module top_module(
    Y,
    A,
    B
);

code:
module top_module(
    Y,
    A,
    B
);output Y;
    input  A;
    input  B;

    // Assign the output Y to the XNOR of inputs A and B
    assign Y = ~(A ^ B);

endmodule

