Design a D-type transparent latch that captures the input signal D on the rising edge of the gate signal GATE. The output Q reflects the value of D as long as GATE is high, effectively allowing the D input to pass through to Q when the latch is enabled. The module also includes power and ground inputs for proper operation within a digital circuit, making it suitable for integration into larger systems requiring controlled data storage elements.
