description:
Design a D flip-flop with an asynchronous active-low set feature. On each rising edge of the CLK signal, if the SET_B input is low, the output Q is set to 0. Otherwise, Q takes the value of the D input. This module allows for resetting the output independently of the clock signal, enabling precise control in digital circuits.
module top_module(
  input CLK, D, SET_B,
  output reg Q
);

code:
module top_module(
  input CLK, D, SET_B,
  output reg Q
);always @(posedge CLK) begin
    if (!SET_B) // Asynchronous set
      Q <= 0;
    else
